  "integration": {
    "summary": "Block-read up to 128 holding registers from wire address 50000 for frequencies, modes, flags and alarms, and from 50100 for the 32-bit generator values and energy. To command the unit, release functions to the interface in 7645, then switch them in 7644; write setpoints to 7640-7642 and 7780.",
    "minimum_registers": [
      {
        "table": "holding_register",
        "address": 50010,
        "why": "Generator frequency"
      },
      {
        "table": "holding_register",
        "address": 50023,
        "why": "Busbar frequency"
      },
      {
        "table": "holding_register",
        "address": 50032,
        "why": "Phase angle generator / bus"
      },
      {
        "table": "holding_register",
        "address": 50056,
        "why": "Synchronizer state"
      },
      {
        "table": "holding_register",
        "address": 50057,
        "why": "Load control mode"
      },
      {
        "table": "holding_register",
        "address": 50075,
        "why": "Alarms 1"
      },
      {
        "table": "holding_register",
        "address": 50100,
        "why": "Total generator power (32-bit)"
      },
      {
        "table": "holding_register",
        "address": 50114,
        "why": "Generator current 1 (32-bit)"
      }
    ],
    "enable": "RS-485 (serial interface 2): set Modbus slave ID 3188 (default 1; 0 disables Modbus), baud 3170 (default 19.2 kBd), parity 3171 (default none), stop bits 3172 (default one). Network B Modbus/TCP slave ID is parameter 5451 (default 255). Release remote functions in 7645.",
    "watchdog": "No timeout parameter is given. On an interface connection loss the discrete-input states stay as they were; energising DI 22 'Modbus reset' returns all functions to hardware control and clears the control bits.",
    "quirks": [
      "Some PLCs need the address shifted by one; the manual notes 450001 may become bus address 50000.",
      "32-bit parameters such as 7642 and 7780 are written as two registers in one request, high word first.",
      "Bits of 7644/7645 are numbered 01-16 in the manual without saying whether 01 is the least significant bit, so no bit map is given here; check on a test unit before relying on a bit position."
    ],
    "setup": [
      "Network B default IP address is 192.168.1.1 (parameters 5430-5433).",
      "Reply delay for RS-485 is parameter 3189 (0.00-2.55 s)."
    ],
    "gotchas": [
      "Releasing Run/Permissive to the interface lets the PLC close the generator breaker via synchronisation; test carefully.",
      "After a connection loss you must de-energise DI 22 before 7645 can be set back to interface control."
    ]
  },
  "verified": {
    "date": "2026-11-17",
    "method": "independent re-check of every register against the source PDF"
  }
}
